  "text": "Oncology | SAGE Veterinary Centers\nSkip to Primary Content\nGive Us a Call\nEmergency\nEmergency\nContact Us\nContact Us\nWho We Are\nAbout Us\nGiving Back\nShare Your Story\nOur Team - Campbell\nOur Team - Concord\nOur Team - Dublin\nOur Team - Redwood City\nOur Team - San Francisco\nServices\nView all Services\nCampbell Services\nConcord Services\nDublin Services\nRedwood City Services\nSan Francisco Services\nFor Pet Owners\nFor Pet Owners\nSelf-Service Portal\nAppointment Information\nOnline Pharmacy\nGrief Support\nPet Owner FAQs\nFor Veterinarians\nFor Veterinarians\nE-Learning Portal\nClinical Trials\nRequest Records\nVeterinarian FAQs\nCareers\nGive Us a Call\nEmergency\nContact Us\nOncology\nWe know it can be difficult to discover that your pet has cancer. We’re here to help you every step of the way from diagnosis to treatment.\nThis service is offered in our\nCampbell\n,\nDublin\n,\nSan Francisco\n,\nConcord\n, and\nRedwood City\nlocations.\nOverview\nWe know it can be extremely difficult to discover that your pet has cancer. We’re here to help you every step of the way from diagnosis to treatment.\nWe offer a range of treatment plans and tailor them to the needs of your pet in an effort to attack the disease they are fighting and maintain their lifestyle.\nSAGE oncologists treat cancer using different modalities. They start with a systemic evaluation of your pet and decide on the best treatment plan, which may include chemotherapy, cryotherapy, immunotherapy, radiation therapy, surgery, or a combination of methods. Our goal is to provide you with a range of therapies to best meet your needs and the needs of your pet.\nFor more information on our oncology services, please\nview our brochure here >\nYou can view the forms in PDF format by downloading the free\nAdobe Acrobat reader\n.\nFind a Location\nServices\nSelf-Service Portal\nOnline Pharmacy\nContact Us\nEmergency\n©\nCopyright\n2026\nTerms & Conditions\nAccessibility\nPrivacy Policy\nCareers\nCookie Preferences\n©\nCopyright\n2026",
